Update HCal segmentation classes to avoid mutable members.

Update FCCSWHCalPhiTheta_k4geo and FCCSWHCalPhiRow_k4geo to avoid
the thread-unsafe use of mutable members.  Instead of several arrays,
structure the data as an array of structures which is built lazily
when needed and installed atomically (this is the same strategy
as was used in FCCSWGridModuleThetaMerged_k4geo).
